<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		535.57		vs	  538.71</p>
<p> Operating	  344    million	  vs	   19.33</p>
<p> Current		2.19		vs	   12.31</p>
<p> Net		    1.19		vs	    8.37</p>
<p> EPS		    0.54 yen	  vs	    3.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   2.19 billion	  vs	2.19 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsubishi Chemical Corp is a large all-round chemical manufacturer.</p>
